---

---

<section class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-12 mb-24 lg:mb-48">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-32">
    <h2
      class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-3 font-heading font-medium text-lg uppercase tracking-widest text-swiss-white mt-1"
    >
      About
    </h2>
    <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-9">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <p
          class="font-sans text-xl lg:text-3xl leading-relaxed text-swiss-white mb-6 max-w-4xl"
        >
          Active in the electronic music scene since 1998, Jan Zelinger (Ian
          Kita) is a veteran of the European underground.
        </p>
        <p
          class="font-sans text-xl lg:text-3xl leading-relaxed text-swiss-white max-w-4xl"
        >
          Evolving from vinyl roots into a staple of modern Techno and Tech
          House, his sound is defined by relentless energy, industrial textures,
          and deep, hypnotic rhythms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16 pt-12 border-t-[1px] border-white/10"
      >
        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-heading font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-swiss-white mb-4"
          >
            Milestones & Awards
          </h3>
          <ul
            class="font-sans text-swiss-white text-base space-y-3 p-0 m-0 list-none"
          >
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-swiss-red shrink-0"></span>
              <span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-10 shrink-0">2023</span>
              <span>3rd Place, Bass Awards (DJ & Producer)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-swiss-red shrink-0"></span>
              <span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-10 shrink-0">2011</span>
              <span>Debuted as Ian Kita / First Solo EP</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-swiss-red shrink-0"></span>
              <span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-10 shrink-0">2003</span>
              <span>First Vinyl Release (Samopal Records)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-swiss-red shrink-0"></span>
              <span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-10 shrink-0">1999</span>
              <span>Began performing as DJ Kita</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-heading font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-swiss-white mb-4"
          >
            Selected Labels
          </h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-swiss-white text-base leading-relaxed m-0">
            Natura Viva, Black Square Recordings, Egothermia Records, Yin Yang
            Records, Baikonur Records, Licker Records, Ushuaia Music.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-heading font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-swiss-white mb-4"
          >
            Selected Festivals
          </h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-swiss-white text-base leading-relaxed m-0">
            Summer of Love, Beat For Love, Coal Festival, Hradhouse, Citadela.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-heading font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-swiss-white mb-4"
          >
            Residencies & Projects
          </h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-swiss-white text-base leading-relaxed m-0">
            Founder of 100% Tech House and Sklep House. Ambassador for the MOAI
            Ecosystem.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
